     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hello -<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI am currently in the process of trying to incorporate the &#39;arima&#39; function from the stats package.  So far, I have been able to bring in the necessary c code and compile from source.  However, when running the function, I receive the following run time exception :<br>\r\n<br>\r\nsys::Err: org.renjin.eval.EvalException: Exception calling list(name = ARIMA_CSS, address = org.renjin.sexp.ExternalPtr@5879d74e, numParameters = c(6L)) : Unimplemented GNU R API function &#39;Rf_ScalarReal&#39;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNot sure where to go from here!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks in advance,</blockquote></div></div>"
